---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Zeta"
  description="Learn how Zeta collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal information when you visit our website or submit an inquiry."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-compact">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Privacy</p>

      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

      <p>
        Zeta is committed to respecting and protecting your privacy.
        This Privacy Notice explains how we collect, use, store, and
        safeguard the personal information you provide when using our
        website or contacting us through our online forms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Privacy Content -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell prose">

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <p>
        Depending on the form you complete, we may collect information such
        as your name, email address, mobile number, location, and other
        details you voluntarily provide in connection with career inquiries,
        consultations, or general communication.
      </p>

      <p>
        We only request information that is relevant to responding to your
        inquiry, processing your application, or improving the services we
        provide.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

      <p>
        Personal information is used solely for legitimate business
        purposes, including:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Responding to inquiries and requests</li>
        <li>Communicating regarding career opportunities</li>
        <li>Scheduling consultations or interviews</li>
        <li>Managing recruitment and application processes</li>
        <li>Improving our website and visitor experience</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Security</h2>

      <p>
        We implement reasonable administrative, organizational, and
        technical measures to protect personal information against
        unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or loss. Access to
        submitted information is limited to authorized personnel who require
        it for legitimate business purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing of Information</h2>

      <p>
        Zeta does not sell or rent personal information. Information may be
        shared only with trusted service providers that support our website,
        communication, recruitment, scheduling, or business operations, and
        only when necessary to provide the requested services or comply with
        applicable legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>

      <p>
        Personal information is retained only for as long as necessary to
        fulfill the purpose for which it was collected or to comply with
        applicable legal, regulatory, or operational requirements.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>

      <p>
        Subject to applicable law, you may request access to your personal
        information, ask that inaccurate information be corrected, withdraw
        consent where appropriate, or request the deletion of information
        that is no longer necessary for the purposes for which it was
        collected.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Notice or wish to exercise
        your privacy rights, please contact Zeta using the information
        provided on our Contact page.
      </p>

      <p class="verification-note">
        This Privacy Notice should be reviewed periodically and updated as
        our website, business processes, technology, or applicable laws
        change. Zeta recommends obtaining appropriate legal review to ensure
        compliance with the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173)
        and other applicable regulations.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
